---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="AI replies that sound like you">
  <section class="container hero">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span data-zh="适用于 X 创作者的回复助手">Thoughtful replies for X</span></div>
      <h1><span data-zh="每一次回复，都更像你。">Replies that sound like you.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead"><span data-zh="读懂对话，参考你的写作风格，生成自然、幽默或有观点的回复草稿。你可以修改、复制或填入 X 回复框，发送始终由你决定。">Reply Copilot reads the conversation and your writing style to suggest natural, playful, or thoughtful drafts. Edit and send only when they feel right.</span></p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/login"><span data-zh="开始 7 天免费体验">Start a 7-day free trial</span> →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/guide"><span data-zh="了解如何使用">How it works</span></a></div>
      <p class="fineprint"><span data-zh="每日 30 次生成 · 无需信用卡 · 内测阶段">30 generations per day · No credit card · Currently in beta</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="product-frame" aria-label="Illustrative product preview">
      <div class="frame-head"><span>● ● ● &nbsp; x.com</span><span data-zh="示意界面，非真实录屏">Illustrative preview · not a video</span></div>
      <div class="frame-post"><span class="avatar">A</span><strong>@alexbuilds</strong><p style="margin:14px 0 0" data-zh="做产品最难的部分，不是开始，而是每天回来再做一点。">The hardest part of building isn't starting. It's showing up again tomorrow.</p></div>
      <div class="reply-card"><div class="reply-tabs"><span data-zh="自然">Natural</span><span data-zh="幽默">Playful</span><span data-zh="观点">Thoughtful</span></div><p style="line-height:1.7;margin:0" data-zh="太真实了。真正拉开差距的，往往就是那些没人看见、但你还是继续做的日子。">This hits. The quiet days when nobody's watching are usually where the real progress happens.</p><div class="fineprint" style="margin-top:14px" data-zh="草稿可编辑 · 发送由你决定">Editable draft · You choose whether to send</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="更好的对话">Better conversations</div><h2 data-zh="让回复有你的声音。">Your voice, three ways.</h2><p data-zh="同一个帖子给出三种不同角度。切换已有候选不消耗额外次数。">One post, three useful angles. Switching between suggestions does not use another generation.</p></div><div class="grid-3"><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">✦</span><h3 data-zh="自然">Natural</h3><p data-zh="像朋友一样真诚接话，贴合原帖，不刻意推销。">A genuine response that follows the original post without sounding promotional.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">◌</span><h3 data-zh="幽默">Playful</h3><p data-zh="轻松一点，留住有趣的瞬间，而不是硬造笑点。">A lighter tone that notices the funny part without forcing a joke.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">↗</span><h3 data-zh="观点">Thoughtful</h3><p data-zh="补充真实看法，让讨论往前走一步。">Add a point of view that moves the conversation forward.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-3"><div class="grid-span-2"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="你的表达方式">Voice Profile</div><h2 data-zh="写作样本让建议更贴近你。">Give it examples. Keep your voice.</h2><p class="lead" data-zh="设置语气、兴趣与写作样本。Reply Copilot 生成草稿时会参考这些内容，你随时可以修改个人风格。">Set your tone, interests, and writing samples. Reply Copilot uses them when drafting, and you can change them anytime.</p></div><div class="content-card"><h3 data-zh="你始终掌控发送">You stay in control</h3><p data-zh="建议可以填入 X 回复框，供你检查和编辑。插件不会自动点击发送。">Suggestions can enter X's reply box for your review. The extension never presses Send for you.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="内测价格">Beta access</div><h2 data-zh="先体验，再决定。">Try it first.</h2></div><div class="grid-3"><div class="pricing-card featured"><h3 data-zh="7 天免费体验">7-Day Free Trial</h3><div class="price">$0</div><p data-zh="每日 30 次生成，由云端提供 AI；无需自己的 API Key。">30 generations a day, with hosted AI. No personal API key needed.</p><a class="button" href="/login" data-zh="开始体验">Start trial</a></div><div class="pricing-card grid-span-2"><h3 data-zh="终身许可证 · 即将开放">Lifetime License · Coming soon</h3><div class="price">$10 <small style="font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0;color:#69717e" data-zh="早鸟计划价">planned early-bird price</small></div><p data-zh="一次性买断软件使用权，自带 DeepSeek API Key。未来计划原价 $15。">One-time software license with your own DeepSeek API key. Planned regular price: $15.</p><p class="notice" data-zh="买断价格不包含终身免费 AI API 调用。付款尚未开放。">The license does not include free lifetime AI API usage. Checkout is not available yet.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2 data-zh="常见问题">Questions, answered.</h2></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="它会自动发送评论吗？">Will it post for me?</h3><p data-zh="不会。你可以编辑草稿，并且必须自己确认发送。">No. You review and edit the draft, then decide whether to send it.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="试用需要自己的 API Key 吗？">Do I need an API key for the trial?</h3><p data-zh="不需要。7 天试用期间，每天最多 30 次云端生成。">No. The 7-day trial includes up to 30 hosted generations per day.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="现在能购买终身版吗？">Can I buy the lifetime version now?</h3><p data-zh="暂时不能。价格是计划，付款功能尚未上线。">Not yet. Pricing is planned; payments have not launched.</p></div><div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="button secondary" href="/faq" data-zh="查看更多问题">More answers</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
